5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to understand why we feel crowded or alone. Let's look at the shared-house year.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who pays for what. Let's check the separately booked rooms cost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I sleep badly away from home. I need to know about bathing hours and bathroom provision.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Travel eats my days. I will look into ferry sailings and train time.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I need to know the total cost before we commit. I will check all-in rates.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, do you think the bathroom situation affects your sleep?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, knowing the total cost helps me feel safe about the budget.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"Yes, the water temperature and timing matter a lot to me.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,The train time is much shorter than the ferry. That is good.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. Predictability is key for me.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will also look at how last year's days ran to see the pattern.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also check the pricing of offshore houses to compare costs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will also look at inn mealtimes to see if the schedule is strict.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check getting around by train and bus for flexibility.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will also check valley inn rates versus urban beds for comparison.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
