35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,Last year we barely met. The shared house year had no space for solitude.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The separate rooms cost nearly 8,000 yen more than a whole house.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The island house has one bathroom and cold water. The inn has strict meal times.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ferry takes two days. The train is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"All-in rates charge light eaters the same as big eaters. Valley inns are 17,000 yen.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, the train time is much better for preserving our days.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, the all-in rate seems unfair if we eat differently.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,I really dislike the idea of one bathroom for everyone.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. The ferry schedule is too restrictive.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"The valley inn includes meals, which simplifies the budget.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"The city option allows separate days, which might solve the crowding issue.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,But the city beds are expensive and meals are extra.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"The city has no timetable, which is good for my sleep.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The city trains are frequent, so we don't wait.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The city cost is unpredictable, which worries me.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I prefer the structure of the inn but the freedom of the city.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I want a clear bill. The island house bill is even.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I am worried about the island bathroom.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,The island travel time is too long.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,I need to see the final numbers for the city.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
